  "properties": {
    "title": "Translation Management in FOSS - The Case of GeoServer",
    "description": "One of the keys for FOSS to have a large audience in several countries is to offer the possibility to use different languages in the system, especially for the softwares with a user interface. \r\n\r\nThrough the case of GeoServer, we will see what can be translated in a software, what features are expected to offer a good translation management and what translation means in terms of development process.",
